.git*
# Anchored with a leading slash: a bare `src` matches at any depth, and the entry point
# is dist/src/functions — unanchored, it shipped a package with no functions in it.
/.vscode
/.github
/infra
/test
/scripts
/src
/tsconfig.json
/vitest.config.ts
/local.settings.json

# The preview server is a dev tool; its compiled form has no business in production.
dist/scripts

# NOTE: public/ must NOT be listed here — the dashboard function reads public/index.html
# out of the deployment package at runtime.
